  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribuci&#xf3;n a la reducci&#xf3;n de la pobreza en la regi&#xf3;n de Am&#xe9;rica Latina y el Caribe a trav&#xe9;s de la sericultura con enfoque sustentable y agregado de valor local</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project submitted by Argentina aims at ensuring sustainable growth through sustainable agriculture (silk worm production). It will improve technical and organisational capacities of the research centres, access to new techniques and technology and contribute to improve the quality of life of the population mainly in rural areas (peasants, women).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
